 864		This formalization-only auxiliary is not a named statement of the paper;
 865		it proves the crosswise EPR exchange independently, without assuming
 866		symmetry of the strategy. The permutation of the six registers
 867		exchanging $\mathsf{A}' \leftrightarrow \mathsf{B}''$ and
 868		$\mathsf{A}'' \leftrightarrow \mathsf{B}'$ fixes $\ket{\hat\psi}$, since
 869		each EPR vector is symmetric, and carries the placement
 870		$\mathsf{A}\mathsf{A}'$ to $\mathsf{A}\mathsf{B}''$ and
